      "created_at": "2025-08-26T20:25:58.361Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hello everyone,</p>\n<p>I would like to put reactions (like, thumbs up, etc) to the comments on ERP Next but I can’t seem to see if there’s any settings I can select.</p>\n<p>Has anyone managed to implement it in their ERP?</p>\n<p>Thanks</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/4/84ee875add013b5e76110823f9864335265bed4a.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/84ee875add013b5e76110823f9864335265bed4a\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/4/84ee875add013b5e76110823f9864335265bed4a_2_690x208.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"iXY4r1CaZswhte7R52p8r8j55uG\" width=\"690\" height=\"208\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/4/84ee875add013b5e76110823f9864335265bed4a_2_690x208.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/4/84ee875add013b5e76110823f9864335265bed4a_2_1035x312.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/4/84ee875add013b5e76110823f9864335265bed4a.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBFBFB\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1119×338 19.9 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
